WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.048
Theo: Whiskers was in my pocket a minute ago.

2
00:00:18.049 --> 00:00:20.375
Now he's disappeared!

3
00:00:20.376 --> 00:00:23.471
Riley: He couldn't have gone very far.

4
00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:27.440
Skyler: He must be close by.

5
00:00:27.441 --> 00:00:34.114
Kids: Here, Whiskers! Come on, Whiskers!

6
00:00:34.115 --> 00:00:39.436
Sarah: I'll look under the couch.

7
00:00:39.437 --> 00:00:47.046
Ben: I'll look behind the chair.

8
00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:51.953
Theo: Maybe Snooks can help us find Whiskers.

9
00:00:51.954 --> 00:00:55.878
Skyler: That's right. Snooks is a hound dog.

10
00:00:55.879 --> 00:00:58.615
He has a good nose for smelling!

11
00:00:58.616 --> 00:01:04.136
Sarah: Come on, Snooks. Find Whiskers!

12
00:01:04.137 --> 00:01:06.253
Snooks: Ah-choo!

13
00:01:06.254 --> 00:01:09.761
Riley: Dust makes Snooks sneeze.

14
00:01:09.762 --> 00:01:13.978
Then his nose gets stuffed up.

15
00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:23.696
Snooks: Ah-choo!

16
00:01:23.697 --> 00:01:26.700
Skyler: Look what I found on the kitchen floor.

17
00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:30.823
Skyler: A cookie! With a bite out of it.

18
00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:33.359
Theo: I bet Whiskers did that.

19
00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.859
He loves cookies!

20
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:43.932
Riley: Aha! That means Whiskers is nearby.

21
00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:49.977
Riley: Uh-oh. We forgot to put the lid on Sammy's cage.

22
00:01:49.978 --> 00:01:52.901
Kelli: It's a good thing that snake didn't get out!

23
00:01:52.902 --> 00:01:55.955
Riley: That's not what I'm worried about.

24
00:01:55.956 --> 00:01:59.321
Theo: What do you mean?

25
00:01:59.322 --> 00:02:06.051
Riley: I . . . uh . . . Well . . . I was wondering.

26
00:02:06.052 --> 00:02:11.624
Riley: Do snakes ever eat hamsters?

27
00:02:11.625 --> 00:02:13.914
Ben: They might if . . .

28
00:02:13.915 --> 00:02:16.630
Theo: If what?

29
00:02:16.631 --> 00:02:19.577
Ben: If they got the chance.

30
00:02:19.578 --> 00:02:26.343
Once Sammy got loose and ate a mouse.

31
00:02:26.344 --> 00:02:30.328
Skyler: So if Sammy could eat a mouse…

32
00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:33.601
Theo: He could eat a hamster!

33
00:02:33.602 --> 00:02:36.108
Sarah: That means . . .

34
00:02:36.109 --> 00:02:48.937
Skyler: Sammy ate Whiskers for dessert!
